    entry_requirements = '<div class="accordion__content" id="Entry_requirements-4" style="--panel-height: 146px;"> <p>To be eligible for admission, all applicants need to satisfy minimum requirements outlined at <a aria-label="Link admission requirements" href="https://www.notredame.edu.au/study/admission-requirements" rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="-1" target="_blank" title="https://www.notredame.edu.au/study/admission-requirements">admission requirements</a>. These include those relating to age and <a aria-label="Link English Language Proficiency" href="https://www.notredame.edu.au/study/admission-requirements/english-language-proficiency-requirements" rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="-1" target="_blank" title="https://www.notredame.edu.au/study/admission-requirements/english-language-proficiency-requirements">English Language Proficiency</a>.</p><p>For admission to the Graduate Certificate in Wellbeing in Education, applicants must have a Bachelor or postgraduate degree in teaching/education or a cognate discipline.</p> </div>',
