    entry_requirements = '<div class="accordion__content" id="Entry_requirements-3" style="--panel-height: 190px;"> <p style="text-align: left;">The <a href="https://www.notredame.edu.au/study/applications-and-admissions/admission-requirements">minimum entry requirements</a> of The University of Notre Dame Australia apply for the Undergraduate Certificate in Counselling.</p><p style="text-align: left;">While minimum entry requirements need to be met, we also consider a student’s application more broadly — their non-academic achievements (professional work experience, leadership roles, volunteering, community and/or church involvement), as well as their personal qualities, aspirations, interests and capacity to successfully complete this program.</p> </div>',
